        {
            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Element name</td><td>Type</td><td>Semantics</td></tr><tr><td>ProviderID</td><td>simpleType:nameTyperefer to Annex A for the type definition</td><td>Alphanumeric characters referring to the eMSP. These are nominally the country code and the provider ID similar to those included in the EMAID. Refer to C.1 for more details of EMAID. The list shall be in ascending order with 0-9 followed by A-Z. All characters shall be in uppercase only.The SupportedProviders includes at least 1 Provider and may include up to 128 providers.</td></tr></table>",
